      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i need some advice. my neighbor has this huge automated hydroponic setup in their backyard and the misting cycles happen at really weird times, like late at night when it's dead quiet. every time it goes off, there's this really heavy, sickly sweet smell that drifts right into my bedroom window. i've been feeling super lightheaded and jittery ever since they installed it. what are some ways i can neutralize the airborne particulates or stuff coming from those plants so it stops getting into my house?",
